## The change

`overrides.next` moves from 16.4.1 to 16.4.6 in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`. Spec FR-2 puts the
resolution version in that block. Twelve manifests declare `next` 16.4.6: the eleven app
manifests of the Red run and `packages/api`. `apps/reading-advantage` pins `@next/env` 16.2.9;
that pin moves to 16.4.6.

No eslint-config-next change. Four apps declare it through the catalog range `^16.0.0`. The
range already allows 16.4.6, so the catalog stays. `apps/www-reading-advantage` declares
`@next/mdx` with the range `^16.2.9`. It stays too.

